# Fetched raw vendor levels — NOT committed. This repository is PUBLIC,
# and the cache holds Tier 2 licensed data (Chicago Fed NFCI levels, and
# any Moody's-derived series added later) whose terms permit internal
# computation but not redistribution. Committing it here would BE
# redistribution. See the licence tiers in ma_data.py.
#
